TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_Twinspire_Mk_I=Twinspire Mk I
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_Twinspire_Mk_I=A Twin Turret-based vessel with a single engine. A step up from the Junkraker, but still a far cry from modern designs.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_Twinspire_Mk_II=Twinspire Mk II
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_Twinspire_Mk_II=A Twin Nosed vessel with a single engine. A step up from the Junkraker, but still a far cry from modern designs.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_Twinspire_Mk_III=Twinspire Mk III
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_Twinspire_Mk_III=A Twin Nosed vessel with a single engine. Very similar to the Mk II with just 1 utility and a single 4x turret. Still a far cry from modern designs, but a solid step up from the Mk II.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_Twinspire_Mk_IV=Twinspire Mk IV
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_Twinspire_Mk_IV=A Twin Nosed vessel with a single engine. An upgrade from the Mk II with 3x Nose turrets and a single utility. Still a far cry from modern designs, but a solid step up from the Mk II.

