TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_QuantumFluxSingularityDrive_Mk1=Quantum Flux Singularity Drive Mk I
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_QuantumFluxSingularityDrive_Mk1=An experimental singularity-coupled drive that harnesses controlled micro-singularities to boost thrust and exhaust velocity with excellent efficiency at small scales.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_QuantumFluxSingularityDrive_Mk2=Quantum Flux Singularity Drive Mk II
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_QuantumFluxSingularityDrive_Mk2=A refined singularity drive with improved stability and power handling, delivering substantially higher thrust and performance than Mk I.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_QuantumFluxSingularityDrive_Mk3=Quantum Flux Singularity Drive Mk III
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_QuantumFluxSingularityDrive_Mk3=A mature singularity drive implementation offering extreme thrust and exhaust velocity for advanced spacecraft.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_QuantumFluxSingularityDrive_Mk4=Quantum Flux Singularity Drive Mk IV
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_QuantumFluxSingularityDrive_Mk4=An advanced singularity drive design with enhanced stability and power handling, delivering exceptional thrust and performance for high-end spacecraft.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_QuantumFluxSingularityDrive_Mk5=Quantum Flux Singularity Drive Mk V
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_QuantumFluxSingularityDrive_Mk5=A cutting-edge singularity drive implementation that pushes the boundaries of thrust and exhaust velocity for top-tier spacecraft.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_QuantumFluxSingularityDrive_Mk6=Quantum Flux Singularity Drive Mk VI
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_QuantumFluxSingularityDrive_Mk6=Master singularity drive technology to achieve unparalleled thrust and exhaust velocity for the most advanced spacecraft.

TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_QuantumCascadeDrive_Mk1=Quantum Cascade Drive Mk I
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_QuantumCascadeDrive_Mk1=A high-thrust electromagnetic drive optimized for rapid inner planet transit, trading fuel efficiency for powerful acceleration on short-range routes where refueling stations are available.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_QuantumCascadeDrive_Mk2=Quantum Cascade Drive Mk II
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_QuantumCascadeDrive_Mk2=An improved cascade drive with enhanced thrust and moderately better efficiency, delivering faster transit times for inner system logistics and rapid response missions.
TIProjectTemplate.displayName.Project_QuantumCascadeDrive_Mk3=Quantum Cascade Drive Mk III
TIProjectTemplate.summary.Project_QuantumCascadeDrive_Mk3=An advanced cascade drive featuring exceptional thrust capabilities for rapid Earth-Mars-Venus-Mercury transit, the premier choice for high-speed inner system fleet operations.

